  m_text: '<b>1.</b> Visit the fridge and press <b>E</b> to browse, click an item,
    or use 1 / 2 / 3.

    <b>2.</b> Chop raw vegetables for 2s. Cook raw meat on
    either stove for 6s. Cheese is ready.

    <b>3.</b> Carry only one item and
    serve it at the matching named customer table.

    <b>4.</b> Faster orders score
    more. Wrong items stay in your hands; trash unwanted items.


    The bottom
    bar always tells you the controls and your best next action.'
